### TicketHub — manual API walkthrough
### Open in IntelliJ and click the green arrows, or copy the curl equivalents
### from the README.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 1

### 1. Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. List events
GET {{host}}/api/events

### 3. Seat map for event 1 (200 seats)
GET {{host}}/api/events/1/seats

### 4. Hold two seats
# Copy `holdId` from the response into the @holdId variable below.
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2]
}

### 5. Try to hold the SAME seats again — expect 409 SEAT_UNAVAILABLE
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatIds": [1, 2]
}

### 6. Confirm the hold
@holdId = PASTE_HOLD_ID_HERE

POST {{host}}/api/bookings/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "holdId": "{{holdId}}",
  "userId": 1
}

### 7. Fetch the booking
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/1

### 8. List this user's bookings
GET {{host}}/api/bookings?userId=1

### 9. Cancel it — seats return to AVAILABLE
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/1/cancel?userId=1

### 10. Confirm the seats are free again
GET {{host}}/api/events/1/seats

### ── Expiry check ────────────────────────────────────────────
### Hold seats and do NOT confirm. After 120 seconds the sweeper
### logs "Expiry sweep released N seat(s)" and this returns them
### to AVAILABLE.
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatIds": [50]
}

### ── Validation / error cases ────────────────────────────────

### Empty seat list -> 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatIds": []
}

### Seat from another event -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatIds": [205]
}

### More than 8 seats -> 400 BAD_REQUEST
POST {{host}}/api/bookings/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "eventId": 1,
  "seatIds": [10,11,12,13,14,15,16,17,18]
}

### Unknown booking -> 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/bookings/9999
